          "type": "heading",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "text": "Ways to get involved.",
            "level": "h2",
            "size": "auto",
            "eyebrow": "Live programs"
          },
          "variant": "plain"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_n6jg2vd1m6",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "With care-based programs to foster solidarity within our neighborhoods and communities, and to bridge with the displaced original ancestors of these lands to find a good way forward together, SPIRIT aims to provide a practical backbone for the establishment of the Front Range Bioregional Commons."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "↳ "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The SPIRIT programs all interconnect.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Solidarity Suppers foster relationships, the Commons Sense teachings build understanding, the Neighborhood Resiliency Program builds enduring capacity, and the Grant Rounds (coming soon) put resources in motion."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
