          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "★ the four pillars are activated through the programs we run"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "SPIRIT is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit that",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " exists to serve the "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Commons",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "/the-commons/"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", and "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "not",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " to perpetuate itself. SPIRIT is the vessel that interfaces with the existing world of foundations, governments, and formal partnerships to offer programming, education, and fiscal sponsorship to serve the regeneration of the Front Range. We are a "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Transitional Stewardship",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " team designing the SPIRIT institution to be replaced by the decentralized, member-directed Commons."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "— 06 —"
                    }
                  ]
